  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing inclusion in education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the 2030 deadline for the Sustainable Development Goals rapidly approaching, we need &#x2013; now, more than ever &#x2013; inclusive education systems. We have long way to go.  250 millions of children and young people are still denied their right of education. UNESCO recognizes that inclusion calls for transformation. It will support its Member States in their efforts towards this transformation by promoting policy dialogue at global and regional levels, strengthening national capacities towards more inclusive policy frameworks and education systems  and fostering global, regional and national partnerships.</narrative>
  </description>
